
{"id":"d287494c-8648-4bad-900f-c38384e0acc1","object":"chat.completion","created":1784820841,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"implementation\": \"import heapq\\ndef solve(case):\\n    nodes = case['payload']['nodes']\\n    threshold = case['payload']['utility_threshold']\\n    node_dict = {n['id']: n for n in nodes}\\n    children = {}\\n    for n in nodes:\\n        pid = n.get('parent')\\n        if pid is not None:\\n            children.setdefault(pid, []).append(n['id'])\\n        else:\\n            children.setdefault(n['id'], [])\\n    heap = []\\n    in_heap = set()\\n    for n in nodes:\\n        key = (-n['depth'], n['id'])\\n        heapq.heappush(heap, key)\\n        in_heap.add(n['id'])\\n    removed = set()\\n    visit_order = []\\n    while heap:\\n        neg_depth, nid = heapq.heappop(heap)\\n        in_heap.discard(nid)\\n        if nid in removed:\\n            continue\\n        visit_order.append(nid)\\n        node = node_dict[nid]\\n        child_list = children.get(nid, [])\\n        is_leaf = all(c in removed for c in child_list)\\n        if node['removable'] and node['utility'] <= threshold and is_leaf:\\n            removed.add(nid)\\n            parent_id = node.get('parent')\\n            if parent_id is not None and parent_id not in removed and parent_id not in in_heap:\\n                pnode = node_dict[parent_id]\\n                heapq.heappush(heap, (-pnode['depth'], parent_id))\\n                in_heap.add(parent_id)\\n    retained = [n['id'] for n in nodes if n['id'] not in removed]\\n    retained.sort(key=lambda x: (-node_dict[x]['depth'], x))\\n    return {'retained': retained, 'visit_order': visit_order}\"\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to produce a Python function `solve(case)` that processes a tree of nodes, with fields: id, parent, symbol, depth, removable, utility. The task: \"Maintain and update the syntax-guided reduction work queue across accepted an